{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'func \\\\(s Store\\\\) (ReleaseAbandonedAttempt|recordReviewRun|finishDelegatedReviewAttempt|ListDelegationActive|ListDelegationAttempts|RunReviewDispatchContext|reviewAttemptAdmission)|func cmdDelegate(Cancel|Ls)|reapSealedCheckoutProcesses|SealedCheckoutEnv|DelegationStalled|type DelegationActiveRun|type ReviewRun struct' pose-mcp/internal/pose pose-mcp/internal/cli/delegate.go && printf '\\\\n--- reaper with line numbers ---\\\\n' && nl -ba pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_reap_linux.go && printf '\\\\n--- release with line numbers ---\\\\n' && nl -ba pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_release.go && printf '\\\\n--- reap regression tests ---\\\\n' && rg -n -C 5 'DispatchEndsWhatTheReviewer|AbandonedAttempt|RunningAttemptIsNot|owner|escaped|outside' pose-mcp/internal/cli/review_reap_test.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_release_test.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_adapter_containment_regression_test.go\"","aggregated_output":"pose-mcp/internal/cli/delegate.go:861:func cmdDelegateLs(root string, args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) int {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/delegate.go:1107:func cmdDelegateCancel(root string, args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) int {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/delegate.go:1121:\tif attempt.State == posemodel.DelegationStalled && attempt.LatestRun == \"\" && !f.dryRun {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_supervision_linux_test.go:79:\t\t\tif a.State != DelegationStalled || a.Active {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_reap_other.go:5:// reapSealedCheckoutProcesses has no portable way to read another process's\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_reap_other.go:7:func reapSealedCheckoutProcesses(string) ([]string, error) { return nil, nil }\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_wait.go:37:\tcase a.State == DelegationStalled:\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_wait.go:45:\t\tresult.State, result.Code = DelegationStalled, DelegationWaitStalled\np